# Target 2048 web application URL.
# Copy this file to .env before running tests: cp .env.example .env
#
# NOTE: In a standard browser, https://gabrielecirulli.github.io/2048/ executes a client-side
# redirect to https://play2048.co/ (which contains commercial ads and a canvas renderer).
# The Playwright bot intercepts this redirect and blocks ads via `setupGameRouting` in src/storage.ts
# to run against the clean, original DOM-based game.
GAME_URL=https://gabrielecirulli.github.io/2048/
